  "summary": "Emily Blount, Marketing Director at Fashion-Forward Inc., escalated a ticket to an account executive due to a glitch in Campaign-Sender-Elite that sent a massive promotional email to 125,000 subscribers, including those who unsubscribed. The company is now dealing with over 3,000 angry complaints and legal involvement. Urgent written explanation needed by end of day."
}

