{
  "summary": "Initial pressure tests for Sub-Explorer-Deep concluded. Exterior sonar housing micro-fractured at 5,200m, causing internal damage. New housing redesign using syntactic foam composite. delay deployment by 14 days. Estimated repair costs: $6,300. Lithium-sulfur battery packs performed well under pressure. exceeding lifespan by 2 hours. Next test: October 1. Composite material optimistic for Mariana Trench simulation."
}

{
  "summary": "Polymer synthesis project update. Team synthesized Poly-Cryo-7 using high-pressure reactor. Cobalt catalyst increased yield by 18%. Samples degraded at >150°C. 3 fractures in thermal stress tests. Adjusting cross-linking agent ratios. Requesting $2,500 for higher purity chemicals. Data readout at monthly review. Expected higher thermal threshold for commercial viability."
